+/*
+ * The link-quality event (APPLE80211_M_..., number 39): the driver tells wifid how the link is doing, now and then.
+ * wifid makes SCALED_RSSI of it for SpringBoard (the bars of the status bar: SBWiFiManager <- SBSystemStatusWifiDataProvider);
